{"synopsis":"Dengan traits rankf yang dianggap sebagai yang terburuk dari yang terburuk Shin Yusung yang berusia 5 tahun ditinggalkan oleh keluarga Shinoh yang terkenal dalam membesarkan para hunter\nPada tahun yang sama dia bertemu dengan salah satu pemburu terkuat fist king di panti asuhan dan diadopsi olehnya\nfist king menjadi yang terkuat bukan karena traitnya atau kemampuan spesialnya  tapi dengan melatih tubuhnya\nDia memperhatikan fisik Shin Yusung bukan traitnya\nnine blocked yin pathways\nyin pathways menyebabkan mana di tubuhmu meluap memberimu pikiran yang luar biasa dan penampilan seperti dewa Tapi kamu juga meninggal sebelum dewasa\nabundance of bodily yang\nTubuhmu dipenuhi dengan energi yang dapat menyembuhkan nine blocked yin pathways","alternative_title":"Hunter Academy's Battle God Hunter Academy's Greatest War God 헌터 아카데미의 최강투신","author":"Yeon Mosmaen","artist":"Daon Studio","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"85cee807-4877-4b7e-b3f9-21a2c22761f7","number":"40","chapter":"40","title":"Chapter 40","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"fa9b818b-b230-4dd6-a86a-b1962cba630c","number":"39","chapter":"39","title":"Chapter 39","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"6605c2f4-ded1-45ae-a933-a29cc5b38423","number":"38","chapter":"38","title":"Chapter 38","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"5f0d53e7-0bbc-464d-a7af-3db500bcfe1f","number":"37","chapter":"37","title":"Chapter 37","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"cda0486f-5189-4c5f-8f73-141caf9a98f6","number":"36","chapter":"36","title":"Chapter 36","date":"2024-12-03","released":"2024-12-03","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"623ece62-dde1-4e88-9711-a76831d9aae1","number":"35","chapter":"35","title":"Chapter 35","date":"2024-11-23","released":"2024-11-23","images":[]},{"chapter_id":"2415e3d4-4f9a-4d05-81b7-2a85e4c6304e","number":"34","chapter":"34","title":"Chapter 34","date":"2024-12-0